    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Before loading your motorcycle, conduct a comprehensive digital audit. This includes taking high-resolution photographs of the bike from all angles, documenting any existing scratches, dents, or mechanical issues. This audit serves as a reference point for the bike's condition upon delivery.</p>
